To,
The Station House Officer
{{officerStation}}

Subject: Complaint regarding the conduct of a police officer on {{date}}

Sir / Madam,

I, {{complainantName}}, resident of {{complainantAddress}}, wish to place on record the following.

On {{date}} at approximately {{time}}, at {{place}}, I was stopped by a police officer.

Officer details as recorded at the time:
  Name: {{officerName}}
  Buckle number: {{officerBuckle}}
  Station: {{officerStation}}
  Vehicle number: {{officerVehicle}}

What happened:
{{whatHappened}}

The encounter was recorded using an assistance application. Its internal reference is {{sessionRef}}.
{{evidenceSummary}}

I request that this complaint be registered and that I be given an acknowledgement bearing a date.

Yours faithfully,
{{complainantName}}
Date:
Contact number:

To,
The Superintendent of Police / Commissioner of Police
[district or city]

